hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2953","Narrated to us ‘Abbās ibn ‘Abd al-‘Azīm al-‘Anbarī who said: Narrated to us al-Naḍr ibn Muḥammad who said: Narrated to us ‘Ikrimah—he is Ibn ‘Ammār—who said: Narrated to us al-Hirmās ibn Ziyād al-Bāhilī who said:\n“I saw the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) at Minā delivering a sermon to the people while he was mounted upon his camel al-‘Aḍbā’, and I was riding behind Abū [al-Ḥārith].”\n\nCHAPTER:"
